      "text": "```\nOLD-GROWTH CHARACTERISTICS (temperate forest)\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nLIVE STRUCTURE:\n  Multiple canopy layers (not uniform height)\n  Large-diameter trees (species and site dependent: often 60cm+ DBH)\n  Trees of multiple ages (uneven-aged structure)\n  Gap dynamics (individual trees die → small gaps → regeneration patches)"
